#>texture_lichen_map
#:material #!phenomenon

~lichen-map[phenomenon]{branching, concentric rings, iridescence}

// the studio's standing look, so the file opens on texture.website as the line it would make
~lichen-map[close, overcast, handled, as-found](wall)<tile>

word: "lichen map"
science: "Patterns no one made: water, salt, frost and oxidation arranging themselves as they move, dry or grow, each by a rule a student can name."
